REMARK 280  SUBMERGED IN LIQUID NITROGEN, REMOVED FROM THE ANAEROBIC            
REMARK 280  ENVIRONMENT, AND STORED UNDER LIQUID NITROGEN., VAPOR DIFFUSION,    
